🖊️ Was the autopen the real power behind the Biden White House?

@MHowellTweets of the Oversight Project explains why the autopen has become central to questions about who was actually making decisions during Biden's presidency and why it may be one of the biggest constitutional controversies in modern American politics.

🎙️ Listen to the full episode wherever you listen to podcasts, or here: heritage.org/heritage-explai…

Public officials who wield enormous power should be prepared to answer for their decisions.

After invoking the Fifth Amendment and declining to answer questions, Fauci could face contempt proceedings in the Senate.

@allenmendenhall is a Research Fellow in Economic Policy Studies and Senior Advisor for the Free Enterprise Initiative at The Heritage Foundation.

